{"id":"don","lemma":"don","pos":"noun","rank":600,"glosses":["a title of respect to a man, prefixed to first names","gentleman"],"ipa":"/ˈdon/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"dones","feminine":"doña","femininePlural":"doñas"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/13/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-don.wav","examples":[{"text":"Tiene don de palabra.","en":"He talks well.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/424872"},{"text":"Poderoso caballero es Don Dinero.","en":"Money talks.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/438313"},{"text":"Sólo soy un don nadie.","en":"I am just a nobody.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636585"},{"text":"Tenés un don para la música.","en":"You have a gift for music."},{"text":"Tiene un don natural para hablar.","en":"He has a natural gift for speaking."}]}